// SOC-RULE-013: Possible Golden Ticket Use via Kerberos Logon Domain Anomaly (generated from rules/sigma/win_golden_ticket_domain_anomaly.yml; review before use)
SecurityEvent
| where ((EventID =~ "4624" and LogonType =~ "3" and AuthenticationPackageName =~ "Kerberos") and not (TargetDomainName matches regex "^(CORP|NT AUTHORITY)$"))
